  "about_item": [
    "THE ULTIMATE 2-IN-1 TRAVEL COMPANION — Say goodbye to packing bulky slow feeders and messy lick mats! Our innovative clamshell design brilliantly combines a deep slow feeder bowl and a textured lick mat into one compact, travel-friendly unit. Perfect for road trips, camping, hiking, or just a quick trip to the local dog park.",
    "PROMOTES HEALTHY DIGESTION ON THE GO — Unlike standard collapsible bowls that allow dogs to gulp their food, our deep bowl features raised wavy ridges to effectively slow down eating speed. This crucial feature helps prevent choking, regurgitation, and canine bloat, ensuring your furry friend's tummy stays healthy even when away from home.",
    "ANXIETY RELIEF & MENTAL ENRICHMENT — The integrated lid doubles as a soothing lick mat with an engaging maze pattern. Simply spread peanut butter, yogurt, or wet treats on it to distract and calm your dog during stressful situations like car rides, vet visits, thunderstorms, or settling down in an unfamiliar campsite.",
    "MESS-FREE CLAMSHELL & SPACE-SAVING DESIGN — No more dirty backpacks! The clever folding mechanism securely snaps closed, keeping residual food, saliva, and doggy messes locked safely inside. It features a convenient reinforced loop, allowing you to easily attach a carabiner (not included) to your leash, belt, or travel bag for hands-free carrying.",
    "PREMIUM, PET-SAFE & EFFORTLESS TO CLEAN — Your pet’s safety is our top priority. Crafted from flexible, food-grade silicone that is 100% BPA-free and built to withstand rugged outdoor adventures. Cleanup is an absolute breeze—simply wipe it clean, rinse it under a tap, or toss it in the top rack of your dishwasher after your trip."
  ],
